# Shark Tank mobile clip leak

iOS Safari often fails to clip Framer Motion `transform` children inside `overflow: hidden` + `border-radius`. Shark Tank / Blue Gel feast overlays then paint huge sharks outside the die and look “stuck.”

On aquarium clip roots (`SharkTankOverlay`, `BlueGelSharkAttack`, `BlueGelSharkBiteCharge`): set `zIndex: 0`, `transform: translateZ(0)`, and `-webkit-mask-image` / `mask-image` radial white→black. Keep `overflow: hidden`.

Also keep shark cruise delays within one animation cycle (no huge negative delays) and keep orca/tank width fractions modest so they stay inside the face.

## Verification
